WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.402
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.903
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:05.705
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:08.341
President Biden
and Chinese President Xi Jinping

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.410
are reportedly
prepared to announce

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.413
the return of
the direct military hotline,

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.616
and -- this is fun -- they're
letting Biden pick the phone.

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:19.218
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:21.053
The third Republican
presidential debate

00:00:21.053 --> 00:00:22.388
was held last night in Miami.

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:23.689
What's the point?

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:26.659
It's like going to a NSYNC
concert without Justin.

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.295
We don't know the rest of you.

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:31.297
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:33.365
During the first few minutes
of last night's debate,

00:00:33.365 --> 00:00:34.633
moderator Lester Holt

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:36.436
admonished the crowd
several times

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:37.570
for cheering and applauding,

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.838
saying, "Let's not do this."

00:00:39.838 --> 00:00:42.675
Man, you know, our political
decorum is in bad shape

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.343
when the moderator has to talk
to the audience

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:46.912
like they're his ex-wife.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.912 --> 00:00:48.948
"Can we not do this today,
Bethany?

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:52.786
I'm just here
to drop off the kids."

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:54.253
During last night's debate,

00:00:54.253 --> 00:00:55.855
Vivek Ramaswamy criticized

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:57.790
Nikki Haley's
foreign policy views

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.993
and said she was "Dick Cheney
in three-inch heels."

00:01:00.993 --> 00:01:03.596
"Hey, I'm right here,"
said Ron DeSantis.

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:05.931
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.931 --> 00:01:09.068
After Vivek Ramaswamy criticized
Nikki Haley's daughter

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:11.003
for using TikTok
during last night's debate,

00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:12.771
Haley told Ramaswamy to

00:01:12.771 --> 00:01:14.841
"keep my daughter's name
out of your voice."

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:17.110
And even though he was
thousands of miles away,

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:18.912
Chris Rock instinctively ducked.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.447
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:25.051
During last night's debate,
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:26.552
said that voters
shouldn't support

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:28.954
former President Trump in 2024,

00:01:28.954 --> 00:01:32.324
and added that he's a "different
guy than he was in 2016."

00:01:32.324 --> 00:01:35.327
Of course, thanks to Trump
we're all different guys

00:01:35.327 --> 00:01:37.764
than we were in 2016.

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.765
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.765 --> 00:01:42.368
Politico published an article
today after last night's debate

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:45.004
titled "Tim Scott's Girlfriend
Is, in Fact, Real."

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:47.774
However, jury's still out
on Tim Scott.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:49.942
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:51.544
According to a new report,
the quality of the

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:54.280
in-flight food onboard
Air Force Two has improved.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:57.650
Oh, you mean
since Mike Pence used it?

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:01.020
The guy who thinks
oregano is a sin?

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.588
He threw away the beverage cart

00:02:02.588 --> 00:02:05.958
when that Sprite
gave him a hangover.

00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:08.227
The FBI and Italian authorities
announced yesterday

00:02:08.227 --> 00:02:10.263
they arrested 17 men
allegedly connected

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.698
with the Gambino crime family

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:14.400
on charges including Mafia
association and arson.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.469
Though, officials say
it could still be weeks

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:19.238
before Netflix is able to
release a show about it.

00:02:19.238 --> 00:02:21.307
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:25.110
A bear in Florida recently stole
a $45 Taco Bell order

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:27.413
from the front porch of a home.

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:28.281
Wait a minute.

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:29.282
How...

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:32.952
do you spend $45 at Taco Bell?

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:35.121
What did you order? All of it?

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:36.655
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.655 --> 00:02:38.958
And finally, the FDA
has launched an investigation

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:42.428
into counterfeit versions
of the weight-loss drug Ozempic.

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:45.798
Users first became suspicious
when they noticed Wilma.

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:49.235
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:54.006
That was a monologue, everybody!
We're off.

00:02:54.006 --> 00:02:55.441
We've got a great show
for you tonight.

